WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.150 --> 00:00:03.183
- You posted this photo
recently, so I wanna show this.

00:00:04.020 --> 00:00:05.940
Like this is throwback.

00:00:05.940 --> 00:00:06.870
- [Mindy] Yeah, it is.

00:00:06.870 --> 00:00:08.670
- Like is this when y'all
first started the show?

00:00:08.670 --> 00:00:10.560
- Yeah, so when we first did "The Office"

00:00:10.560 --> 00:00:11.760
I mean, this is so sweet,

00:00:11.760 --> 00:00:15.150
the first two seasons of "The
Office," whenever it aired,

00:00:15.150 --> 00:00:17.280
we would go over to someone's house

00:00:17.280 --> 00:00:19.508
and we'd watch the show together.

00:00:19.508 --> 00:00:21.420
- That's so cool people don't do.

00:00:21.420 --> 00:00:22.770
- No, people don't do that.

00:00:22.770 --> 00:00:24.630
And I thought that was normal.

00:00:24.630 --> 00:00:26.700
But like Steve was like
the star of the show

00:00:26.700 --> 00:00:28.410
and like you can tell by the snacks,

00:00:28.410 --> 00:00:30.090
this is not a fancy party.

00:00:30.090 --> 00:00:31.230
- Yeah.

00:00:31.230 --> 00:00:33.570
These are my people with that
snack tray, I'm like cool.

00:00:33.570 --> 00:00:36.090
- Just like pretzel sticks and everything.

00:00:36.090 --> 00:00:38.460
And Angela, we just took turns throwing it

00:00:38.460 --> 00:00:40.740
and there wasn't this idea of
oh my house isn't fancy enough

00:00:40.740 --> 00:00:41.640
'cause it was Hollywood.

00:00:41.640 --> 00:00:43.530
Like we felt so separate,

00:00:43.530 --> 00:00:45.510
well the show is not that
glamorous or anything

00:00:45.510 --> 00:00:46.410
when you watch it,

00:00:46.410 --> 00:00:47.730
but I just, when I saw it,

00:00:47.730 --> 00:00:50.130
I first of all, I was
like "Wow, that's so fun

00:00:50.130 --> 00:00:51.150
that we did that" and then second of all

00:00:51.150 --> 00:00:53.319
I was like Steve Carell is so hot.

00:00:53.319 --> 00:00:54.152
(Kelly laughing)

00:00:54.152 --> 00:00:55.860
I feel like he doesn't get enough credit

00:00:55.860 --> 00:00:57.212
for being like kind of a babe.

00:00:57.212 --> 00:00:59.010
- I'm gonna own this right now.

00:00:59.010 --> 00:01:01.050
So, I have always thought
he was cute, right,

00:01:01.050 --> 00:01:03.540
but he came here, and
it was for our first,

00:01:03.540 --> 00:01:05.100
it was for the first--
- Premiere.

00:01:05.100 --> 00:01:07.140
- Premiere, yeah, 'cause he
did the Kelly Clarkson thing.

00:01:07.140 --> 00:01:08.040
- Of course, in "40 Year Old Virgin."

00:01:08.040 --> 00:01:09.780
- This dude, hanging out back stage,

00:01:09.780 --> 00:01:13.350
he had like a long, like
trench coat like thing.

00:01:13.350 --> 00:01:15.840
He had all this salt
and pepper facial hair.

00:01:15.840 --> 00:01:17.683
I was like "Okay."

00:01:17.683 --> 00:01:18.516
(audience laughing)

00:01:18.516 --> 00:01:22.440
I was like, what the hell
is happening right now?

00:01:22.440 --> 00:01:25.856
Literally, the buzz the
entire day was how hot is

00:01:25.856 --> 00:01:26.880
Steve Carell?
- Steve Carell.

00:01:26.880 --> 00:01:27.713
Yeah.

00:01:27.713 --> 00:01:29.430
- I was like, what?

00:01:29.430 --> 00:01:31.030
Anyway, so I'm with you on that.

